{
    "title": "Mary Kay\u00ae MirrorMe\u2122",
    "description": "Easily create makeup looks you love with Mary Kay MirrorMe\u2122, our new real-time makeover app. Use our new twist on augmented reality to find your most fabulous face from the comfort of your couch or on the go by swiping through countless color combinations on your face, eyes and lips. Mary Kay MirrorMe\u2122 uses your phone\u2019s camera to apply makeup trends and color products the same way they look in real life \u2013 no mess made, and no photo upload necessary! \r\n\u00a0\r\n-  Use the front-facing camera to follow your movement and the rear-facing camera on friends to accurately place makeup on eyes, lips and face. \r\n-  Instantly try on hundreds of Mary Kay\u00ae products, shades and specially curated makeup artist looks .\r\n-  Try on makeup looks before meeting with your Independent Beauty Consultant.\r\n-  Share looks that you design or full looks created by Global Beauty Ambassador Luis Casco with friends across social media platforms, email or save to your device for inspiration. Shop as you play by adding the products you love to your marykay.com bag straight from the app.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Easily create makeup looks you love with Mary Kay MirrorMe\u2122, our new real-time makeover app. Use our new twist on augmented reality to find your most fabulous face from the comfort of your couch or on the go by swiping through countless color combinations on your face, eyes and lips. Mary Kay MirrorMe\u2122 uses your phone\u2019s camera to apply makeup trends and color products the same way they look in real life \u2013 no mess made, and no photo upload necessary! <br>\u00a0<br>-  Use the front-facing camera to follow your movement and the rear-facing camera on friends to accurately place makeup on eyes, lips and face. <br>-  Instantly try on hundreds of Mary Kay\u00ae products, shades and specially curated makeup artist looks .<br>-  Try on makeup looks before meeting with your Independent Beauty Consultant.<br>-  Share looks that you design or full looks created by Global Beauty Ambassador Luis Casco with friends across social media platforms, email or save to your device for inspiration. Shop as you play by adding the products you love to your marykay.com bag straight from the app.",
